<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE - Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	 6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America    13.75 /13.60  14.10 /14.00  14.25 /14.125</p>
<p> BPI		    14.00 /13.80  14.25 /14.00  14.50 /14.25</p>
<p> Citibank	     14.25 /14.025 14.375/14.125 14.50 /14.25</p>
<p> Hongkong Bank	14.20 /13.75  14.50 /14.05  14.625/14.10</p>
<p> Metrobank	    14.00 /13.50  14.25 /13.80  14.625/14.15</p>
<p> PNB		    14.25 /13.75  14.75 /14.30  15.00 /14.00</p>
<p>Standard Chartered 14.00 /13.75  14.25 /14.00  14.50 /14.25</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
